td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">36</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">37</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">38</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">39</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">40</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">41</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">42</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">43</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">44</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">45</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr><tr><td class="dep-line">46</td><td class="dep-num"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="dep-footer"><div class="dep-footer-left"><div class="dep-box"><div class="dep-box-title">Deposit To</div><div class="dep-account">Sample Bank Account #000000000</div></div><div class="dep-envelope">Purple envelope — no tape</div></div><div class="dep-footer-right"><div class="dep-box"><div class="dep-box-title">Deposit Summary</div><div class="dep-sum-row"><span>Total Cash</span><span class="dep-num">$55.00</span></div><div class="dep-sum-row"><span>Total Checks (1)</span><span class="dep-num">$11.00</span></div><div class="dep-sum-grand"><span>SB Bank Total</span><span class="dep-num">$66.00</span></div></div><div class="dep-initials"><span class="dep-initials-label">Prepared by Jordan Rivera</span><span class="dep-initials-slot"><span class="dep-initials-value">MV</span><span class="dep-initials-caption">Initials</span></span></div></div></div><footer class="dep-page-footer">Northfield Dental Group, LLC · Daily Deposit Log · Bank Copy</footer></div>"`;

exports[`print invariant — reference output must never change > FOF patient copy + office copy render byte-for-byte identically 1`] = `"<div class="fof-sheet fof-dense fof-denser"><header class="fof-head"><img class="fof-logo" src="/src/assets/practice-logo.png" alt="Northfield Dental Group, LLC"/><div class="fof-head-meta"><div class="fof-meta-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"></path></svg><span class="fof-meta-key">Date</span><span class="fof-meta-value">7/24/2026</span></div><div class="fof-meta-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><span class="fof-meta-key">Patient</span><span class="fof-meta-value">Reference Patient</span></div></div></header><section class="fof-hero"><div class="fof-hero-treatment"><div class="fof-kicker">Your Treatment</div><div class="fof-treatment-text">Dr. Scott will prepare tooth #14 for a porcelain crown, place a composite filling on tooth #19, and use a surgical guide on implant surgery day, designed to help rebuild a strong, functional bite.</div></div><div class="fof-hero-card"><div class="fof-kicker">Your Total Cost (Your Portion)</div><div class="fof-hero-amount">$3,140.00</div><div class="fof-hero-sub">This is your estimated out-of-pocket amount.</div></div></section><section class="fof-cards"><div class="fof-card fof-breakdown"><div class="fof-card-title">Cost Breakdown</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Total (Estimated) Cost*</span><span>$4,125.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Estimated Insurance Payment***</span><span>−$985.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>You Pay (Your Portion)</span><span>$3,140.00</span></div></div><div class="fof-card fof-callout"><div class="fof-callout-inner"><span class="fof-icon-bubble"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div><div class="fof-card-title">Estimates Only***</div><p>Please note that the calculated insurance payment, including any write-offs, is only an estimate. While we have made every effort to calculate this amount accurately, any insurance underpayment will remain your responsibility. If you believe there has been a change to your insurance coverage, please notify us as soon as possible.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="fof-options"><div class="fof-options-head">Choose Your Payment Option</div><div class="fof-options-row"><div class="fof-option"><div class="fof-option-title"><span class="fof-option-icon"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M15.3 8.6h-4.8a1.85 1.85 0 1 0 0 3.7h3a1.85 1.85 0 1 1 0 3.7H8.7"></path><path d="M12 6.2v11.6"></path></g></svg></span>Option 1 · Prepay in Full — Pay Today &amp; Save</div><div class="fof-option-body"><div class="fof-row"><span>Total Patient Portion</span><span>$3,140.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Prepay Discount**</span><span>−$314.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Total Due with Prepay</span><span>$2,826.00</span></div><div class="fof-save-chip"><span class="fof-save-seal"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><g fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M14.3 9.2h-3.4a1.45 1.45 0 1 0 0 2.9h2.2a1.45 1.45 0 1 1 0 2.9H9.7"></path><path d="M12 7.4v9.2"></path></g></svg></span><span><strong>You save $314.00</strong> when you prepay in full.</span></div></div></div><div class="fof-or">or</div><div class="fof-option"><div class="fof-option-title"><span class="fof-option-icon"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2.5" y="4.5" width="19" height="17" rx="3" fill="currentColor"></rect><g fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 2.5v4M16 2.5v4M2.5 10h19"></path></g></svg></span>Option 2 · Payment Installment Agreement</div><div class="fof-option-body"><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>Upon Scheduling</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$940.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>At Crown Prep</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$1,100.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>On Crown Delivery</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$1,100.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Total Due</span><span>$3,140.00</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="fof-band fof-band-split"><div class="fof-band-cell"><span class="fof-icon-bubble"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg></span><div><div class="fof-band-title">Financing Options Available</div><p>We offer outside financing through trusted providers. Call us at (555) 010-0142 to learn more — or with any questions about this form.</p></div></div></section><div class="fof-footnotes"><span class="fof-info-badge"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 16.2v-5M12 7.8h.01" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><div class="fof-footnotes-list"><p>* The &quot;Total Charges&quot; on this Financial Options Form will remain valid and honored for 60 days from the date listed above.</p><p>** The &quot;Prepay Discount&quot; on this Financial Options Form will be honored if the total amount is paid either at the time of scheduling or at least two weeks prior to the appointment. For appointments scheduled less than two weeks in advance, payment must be made at the time of scheduling to qualify for the discount.</p><p>Your dental plan applies an &quot;alternate benefit&quot; to tooth-colored (composite) fillings on back teeth: insurance pays as if a silver (amalgam) filling were placed. You still receive the tooth-colored filling; the difference up to our standard fee is included in your portion.</p><p>Because this treatment continues into your next insurance benefit year, part of the estimate is paid from next year&#x27;s renewed benefits: your annual maximum starts over for the visits after renewal, and your deductible applies again. If your coverage changes at renewal, this estimate may change as well.</p></div></div><div class="fof-signatures"><p class="fof-sig-ack"><span class="fof-sig-ack-blank"><span class="fof-sig-ack-line"></span><span class="fof-sig-ack-caption">Patient&#x27;s Printed Name</span></span><span class="fof-sig-ack-text">has read this Financial Options Form in its entirety and agrees to the following plan:</span></p><div class="fof-choices"><div class="fof-choice"><span class="fof-checkbox"></span> Prepay in Full Agreement</div><div class="fof-choice"><span class="fof-checkbox"></span> Payment Installment Agreement</div></div><div class="fof-sig-row"><div class="fof-sig-field fof-sig-wide"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Patient Signature</div></div><div class="fof-sig-field"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Date</div></div></div><div class="fof-sig-row"><div class="fof-sig-field fof-sig-wide"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Northfield Dental Group, LLC Representative</div></div><div class="fof-sig-field"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Date</div></div></div></div><footer class="fof-footer"><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.99-5.54 10.19-7.4 11.79a1 1 0 0 1-1.2 0C9.54 20.19 4 14.99 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>41 Northfield Avenue, Springvale, MA 02100</span><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>(555) 010-0142</span><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20M2 12h20"></path></svg>northfielddentalgroup.example</span></footer></div><div class="fof-sheet fof-office-page"><div class="fof-office-head"><div><div class="fof-office-title">Office Copy — FOF Detail</div><div class="fof-office-sub">Patient: Reference Patient · Date: 7/24/2026 · Doctor: Dr. Scott · Template: Out-of-Network Insurance<br/>Created by Jordan Rivera on 7/24/2026 2:30 PM</div></div><div class="fof-office-stamp">Office Use Only</div></div><table class="fof-office-table"><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Th</th><th>Visit</th><th>Category</th><th>Description</th><th class="num">Fee</th><th class="num">Allowable</th><th class="num">Ins Pays</th><th class="num">Write-Off</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>D2740</td><td>14</td><td>2</td><td>Major</td><td>Crown - porcelain/ceramic</td><td class="num">$1,650.00</td><td class="num">$1,200.00</td><td class="num">$600.00</td><td class="num">—</td></tr><tr><td>D2392</td><td>19</td><td>1</td><td>Basic</td><td>Resin composite - 2 surfaces, posterior</td><td class="num">$325.00</td><td class="num">$215.00</td><td class="num">$172.00</td><td class="num">—</td></tr><tr><td>D5982</td><td></td><td>3</td><td>No Coverage</td><td>Surgical stent</td><td class="num">$450.00</td><td class="num">—</td><td class="num">—</td><td class="num">—</td></tr><tr><td>D6010</td><td>30</td><td>3</td><td>Major</td><td>Surgical placement of implant body</td><td class="num">$1,700.00</td><td class="num">$1,400.00</td><td class="num">$213.00</td><td class="num">—</td></tr><tr class="fof-office-totals"><td colSpan="5">Totals</td><td class="num">$4,125.00</td><td class="num"></td><td class="num">$985.00</td><td class="num">$0.00</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="fof-office-summary"><div class="fof-office-col"><div class="fof-card-title">As Printed on the FOF</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Total (Estimated) Cost</span><span>$4,125.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Estimated Insurance Payment</span><span>−$985.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Patient Portion</span><span>$3,140.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Prepay in Full (Prepay Discount)</span><span>$2,826.00</span></div></div><div class="fof-office-col"><div class="fof-card-title">Payment Schedule</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Upon Scheduling</span><span>$940.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>At Crown Prep</span><span>$1,100.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>On Crown Delivery</span><span>$1,100.00</span></div></div></div><p class="fof-office-note">File this page with the signed Financial Options Form. Internal record of the codes and amounts behind the patient-facing summary — not for distribution.</p></div>"`;

exports[`print invariant — reference output must never change > Incident report sheet renders byte-for-byte identically 1`] = `"<div class="inc-sheet"><header class="inc-head"><img src="https://example.invalid/logo.png" alt="Northfield Dental Group" class="inc-logo"/><div class="inc-head-meta"><p class="inc-title">Incident Report</p><div class="inc-meta-item"><span class="inc-meta-key">Employee</span><span class="inc-meta-value">Test Employee</span></div><div class="inc-meta-item"><span class="inc-meta-key">Date</span><span class="inc-meta-value">Monday, July 27, 2026 · 2:45 PM</span></div><div class="inc-meta-item"><span class="inc-meta-key">Status</span><span class="inc-meta-value">Closed</span></div></div></header><div class="inc-grid"><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Type</span><span class="inc-field-value">Sharps / needlestick</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Severity</span><span class="inc-field-value">Moderate</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Location</span><span class="inc-field-value">Operatory 2</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Body part</span><span class="inc-field-value">Left index finger</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Instrument / device</span><span class="inc-field-value">Hu-Friedy scaler</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">PPE worn</span><span class="inc-field-value">Yes</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Medical treatment</span><span class="inc-field-value">First aid on site</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Work related</span><span class="inc-field-value">Yes</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Work days missed</span><span class="inc-field-value">0</span></div></div><div class="inc-block"><p class="inc-block-label">What happened</p><p class="inc-block-value">Stuck on an instrument while cleaning up after an extraction.</p></div><div class="inc-block"><p class="inc-block-label">Action taken immediately</p><p class="inc-block-value">Washed with soap and water, reported to the doctor immediately.</p></div><div class="inc-block"><p class="inc-block-label">Witnesses</p><p class="inc-block-value">Dr. Avery</p></div><div class="inc-review"><p class="inc-block-label">Manager review</p><div class="inc-grid inc-grid-tight"><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Reviewed by</span><span class="inc-field-value">Jordan Rivera</span></div><div class="inc-field"><span class="inc-field-label">Follow-up required</span><span class="inc-field-value">Yes</span></div></div><p class="inc-block-value">Reviewed with the team; sharps container relocated to the counter.</p><p class="inc-block-value">Follow-up: Bloodwork scheduled; source evaluation requested.</p></div><div class="inc-signatures"><div class="inc-sign"><div class="inc-sign-line"><span class="inc-sign-name">Test Employee</span></div><p class="inc-sign-label">Employee signature / date</p><p class="inc-sign-meta">Signed electronically · Jul 28, 2026 at 1:00 PM</p></div><div class="inc-sign"><div class="inc-sign-line"><span class="inc-sign-name">Jordan Rivera</span></div><p class="inc-sign-label">Manager or owner signature / date</p><p class="inc-sign-meta">Signed electronically · Jul 28, 2026 at 5:16 PM · Owner</p></div></div><p class="inc-foot">Filed by Jordan Rivera · Northfield Dental Group, LLC · Workplace safety record — retain per OSHA recordkeeping requirements.</p><footer class="inc-footer"><span class="inc-footer-item">41 Northfield Avenue, Springvale, MA 02100</span><span class="inc-footer-item">(555) 010-0142</span><span class="inc-footer-item">northfielddentalgroup.example</span></footer></div>"`;
